note seed/node/code-cat-main.om -- omnode-code-cat, the coding workflow in
note catalog mode (seed/node/code-cat.om):
note omnode-code-cat INFER TOOL OMC ROOT WORK JDIR PORT RESOLVE CATALOG LOCK
note CARD OBJ [OBJ...], CARD none, sig or full. One hour for the whole run.
fn main to int
ret cw_cmain 1 3600
end
